WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
Some word parts tell you where.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.340
Trans means across.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.220
Inter means between.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.840
Sub means under.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.260
Super means above or beyond.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:15.310
Put one in front of a word, and the word knows where it’s going.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:20.140
Find the part that tells where, then sew the border patch.
